Lenovo ThinkPad Monitor INF/Color Profile
Driver version 5.03.0.0, 14 August 2013

The files in MONITOR_ICC/ are unmodified copies of Lenovo's ThinkPad LCD
monitor profiles and the INF table that selects them:

  TPLCD.INF
  TPLCD.icm
  TPLCD60.icm
  TPLCD95.icm
  TPLCD100.icm
  TPFLX.icm
  TPFLX60.icm
  TPMB60.icm
  TPMB72.icm
  TPMB72_1.icm

Each profile carries Lenovo's own copyright notice from 2005. TPLCD.INF
carries Lenovo's copyright as well. They are kept here, byte for byte,
because Lenovo no longer supports the ThinkPad T530 and these files are the
calibration and the match list for its panels.

This package does not include TPLCD.CAT. That file is the Windows driver
signature and is not part of the color configuration.

t530-icc, README.md, and LICENSE are not Lenovo's files. Their terms are in
LICENSE. Lenovo does not supply or support this package.
